1
00:00:00,122 --> 00:00:01,492
(Amy:)Great.

2
00:00:03,058 --> 00:00:06,428
(Howard:)And where are you?

3
00:00:06,428 --> 00:00:08,628
(Bernadette:)Down here.

4
00:00:18,874 --> 00:00:20,074
(Penny(checking phone):)Oh.

5
00:00:20,075 --> 00:00:21,945
(Howard:)This is new.

6
00:00:21,944 --> 00:00:23,374
(Bernadette:)I didn't know
what else to do.

7
00:00:23,378 --> 00:00:25,648
(Bernadette:)It worked.

8
00:00:25,647 --> 00:00:28,687
(Howard:)Well, I'd say that's
thinking outside the box,

9
00:00:28,684 --> 00:00:30,914
(Penny:)but...
...come on.

10
00:00:33,422 --> 00:00:35,592
(Bernadette:)Don't make me laugh.

11
00:00:36,125 --> 00:00:39,125
(Penny(checking phone):)Oh.

12
00:00:39,128 --> 00:00:40,998
(Howard:)Do you need help getting out?

13
00:00:40,996 --> 00:00:42,766
(Bernadette:)I think I live here now.

14
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,100
(Bernadette:)It's fine.

15
00:00:47,102 --> 00:00:49,002
(Howard:)Is it okay if I get some sleep?

16
00:00:49,004 --> 00:00:50,834
(Penny:)Yeah, go ahead.

17
00:00:55,444 --> 00:00:56,714
(Howard:)Good job, Mommy.

18
00:00:57,980 --> 00:00:59,450
(Howard:)I'm proud of you.

19
00:00:59,448 --> 00:01:03,418
(Bernadette:)Don't make me cry, either.

